---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Experience | Portfolio"
  description="Professional experience in software development, systems, automation and web applications."
  lang="en"
>
  <article class="experience-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">EXPERIENCE</p>

      <h1>Professional experience</h1>

      <p class="intro">
        Experience in web application development, systems, process automation,
        content management and technical support.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="experience-list">
      <section class="experience-item">
        <header class="experience-header">
          <div>
            <h2>IT Systems Operations Technician</h2>
            <p class="company">Confidential company</p>
          </div>

          <p class="duration">≈ 1 year</p>
        </header>

        <div class="experience-content">
          <p>
            Development and maintenance of a web application focused on document
            digitization and management in a professional environment.
          </p>

          <h3>Software and web development</h3>

          <ul>
            <li>
              Development and maintenance of features for a web application.
            </li>
            <li>
              Work with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Bootstrap, jQuery and DataTables.
            </li>
            <li>Development with PHP and work with MySQL databases.</li>
            <li>
              Integration of document storage and management using Google Drive
              and Google Apps Script.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h3>Environments and systems</h3>

          <ul>
            <li>
              Configuration of a physical Windows computer to be used as a
              server together with another colleague.
            </li>
            <li>Configuration and use of Apache, PHP and MySQL.</li>
            <li>
              Use of XAMPP to facilitate development, execution and environment
              configuration.
            </li>
            <li>Use of VirtualBox.</li>
            <li>
              Configuration of IP addresses, ports, users, permissions and
              folder structures.
            </li>
            <li>
              Research and resolution of connection and security-related
              problems.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h3>Automation</h3>

          <ul>
            <li>
              Development and configuration of automations using Microsoft Power
              Automate.
            </li>
            <li>
              Automation of internal processes related to request management.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h3>CMS and institutional portal</h3>

          <ul>
            <li>Work with Magnolia CMS through its graphical interface.</li>
            <li>Creation and modification of pages.</li>
            <li>
              Work with components, templates, content, images, menus,
              navigation and forms.
            </li>
            <li>Participation in content migration and reorganization.</li>
            <li>
              Organization of elements with accessibility and ease of navigation
              in mind.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h3>Maintenance and support</h3>

          <ul>
            <li>Security reviews and testing.</li>
            <li>Backups.</li>
            <li>User support.</li>
            <li>Software installation and configuration.</li>
            <li>Computer setup and configuration.</li>
            <li>Permission and account management.</li>
            <li>
              Use of PowerShell to execute commands related to connections and
              installations.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="experience-item">
        <header class="experience-header">
          <div>
            <h2>Web Application Developer</h2>
            <p class="company">Internship</p>
          </div>

          <p class="duration">3 months</p>
        </header>

        <div class="experience-content">
          <p>
            Participation in the development of a web application focused on
            document digitization and management.
          </p>

          <h3>Main technologies and responsibilities</h3>

          <ul>
            <li>HTML, CSS and JavaScript.</li>
            <li>Bootstrap, jQuery and DataTables.</li>
            <li>PHP and MySQL.</li>
            <li>Google Apps Script.</li>
            <li>
              Development and work on features related to document upload and
              management.
            </li>
            <li>Work with the local environment and server configuration.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .experience-page {
    width: min(calc(100% - 2rem), var(--content-width));
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: 4rem 6rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 750px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .experience-list {
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .experience-item {
    padding-block: 4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .experience-item:first-child {
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: 0;
  }

  .experience-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .experience-header h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .company,
  .duration {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .duration {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .experience-content {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .experience-content > p {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .experience-content h3 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .experience-content ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .experience-content li + li {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .experience-page {
      padding-block: 3rem 5rem;
    }

    .page-header {
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .experience-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .experience-item {
      padding-block: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
